Quest 330 "Nostrum of Constitution"
    Journal for karus "A Nostrum of Constitution is required for learning 70Lv and 75Lv skills, and [Warrior Master] Skaki will make it for you if you bring him 1 Robo's Pendant, 1 Lupus Pendant and 1 Silver Bar, which are the ingredients of Nostrum of Constitution."
    Journal for elmorad "A Nostrum of Constitution is required for learning 70Lv and 75Lv skills, and [Warrior Master] Skaki will make it for you if you bring him 1 Robo's Pendant, 1 Lupus Pendant and 1 Silver Bar, which are the ingredients of Nostrum of Constitution."
